This package installs two Bulgarian dictionaries for aspell:
"bg-wo_english.multi" and "bg-w_english.multi".  The first recognises
only Bulgarian words whilst the second recognises both Bulgarian and
English words.  By default will be used the second dictionary, so you
can easily spell check English texts.

If you think this is misbehaviour you are welcome to use the command

    update-alternatives --config bulgarian-aspell-dictionary

in order to change the default Bulgarian dictionary.

 -- Anton Zinoviev <zinoviev@debian.org>, Tue Sep 20 18:22:36 2005
